    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Groovy is a cone-shaped net climber in Cherry Red that turns on a round base. Children climb the net while the cone rotates, so they have to hold on, shift their weight and work together to keep it moving. It suits 5 to 8 children at a time. Groovy covers only 5'1\" x 5'1\", and its safe play area is 8'1\" x 8'1\". That lets it fit into a small society garden or a gap between larger pieces. The skills it builds are self control and confidence. It is part of the Pinnacle series in our NexLev range and pairs well with a tepee tower from the same series. Its galvanised pipe and play rope net carry a 3-year warranty, while the bearing falls under our 1-year cover. Ask us where it can go on your plan."
     }
    ]
